  "2026-07-25T19:14:52.009Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: resolveAuthorIdentity always performs bounded harness/model observation before selecting explicit, PM_AUTHOR, configured, detected, or unknown author precedence. Tests prove a configured author remains author_source=configured while agent_harness/model remain observable in history. Full suite, 100% coverage, static gates, and packed consumer acceptance passed."
